  usecase "UC-10: Masuk ke Akun (Login)" as UC10
  usecase "UC-17: Keluar Sesi (Logout Aman)" as UC17
  usecase "UC-18: Mengakses Antrean Kurasi Naskah" as UC18
  usecase "UC-19: Memeriksa Indeks Kemiripan (Similarity)" as UC19
  usecase "UC-20: Membuka & Menelaah Galley PDF" as UC20
